WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Listen, so what, so what if you and I are different?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This doesn't scare me at all.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
But I'm afraid of losing you.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Very.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
You know me.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I will remain silent until the last moment,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
because...

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Well, I'm just not emotionally mature

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
and with the exact source of your discomfort,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
who doesn't know how to talk about his feelings.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Maybe because I'm a hardcore loner

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
and that's no excuse.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.000
I just...

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
I should have told you a long time ago

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
that you are the best thing that has ever happened to me in my life.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000
But no, I'm better...

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I'll piss off your ears, I'll tell you that you're trying too hard,

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
although in reality I’m just very worried about you,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
because no one in this world

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.000
doesn't mean more to me than you, Judy.
